ong  only the booster gives a good chance of  preventing omicron disease but uptake of  the top-up jab is slowing in every age  group now in the over-60s rates have  almost leveled off at around 90 percent  but in the under 30s there are already  signs the rapid rise before christmas is  easing off with uptake still only at  around a third  the slowdown could be due to the festive  break but if it continues and rates of  serious disease rise still further the  government may have to rethink its  strategy
 

